      "title": "Error budget remaining (30d)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "The slow-moving number: budget burned over the whole 30-day period, not in the last five minutes. Crossing the dashed zero line means the SLO has been missed for the period, which is a release-freeze conversation rather than a page.\n\nPrometheus retention here is 24h and the 30d SLI is a rolling average of the 5m series, so on a freshly built cluster this is computed over hours, not days. It is honest about the data it has, but do not read it as a true 30-day figure until the cluster has been up that long."
